<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has built new road networks and opened bases in southern Lebanon while striking Qantara and conducting overflights that wounded a Lebanese footballer and led to the detention of a 65‑year-old retired engineer. Hezbollah has arrested five members in Batroun, continued artillery fire on Israeli positions and begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Former Iraqi MP Ahmed al-Alwani was killed in Beirut. France opened a probe into alleged Israeli war crimes and protests against Israeli attacks occurred in Sweden. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE54R1pweUMtN1M4c0dTQ3NCLTQyUFFpWTVVeXZ5ZGhqUlNtSE9PV0xqWHBrTXRhOEwtaXU5aXdXd09KVmt0cXZ0Y2FVdjdCY0NLci0zS01lQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNOHJfTXVYZlRMcmFrTlhwc3AxeU9uOGFXUUZoSkZQVVhRTGRJUkZTcEEwM1lMMVhpWUdZM1hSekpyRG9oYUhoM3ZEcFlqMDdfZGcyMUE4NHlSSUpuMXR0VEtfRkhIYTlHRExaM0l4M3JLREZ2QWJVbWEzNkczdGRiS3ZYRXRhWnRPaU92cUJhQnplMjdHc0ZjdGpB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
